flowchart LR
  Browser[(Utilisateur / Navigateur)] -->|1. Click Sign-in| NextAuth[NextAuth (app/api/auth)]
  NextAuth -->|2. Redirect| Google[Google OAuth]
  Google -->|3. Callback| NextAuth
  NextAuth -->|4. Verify/Create| DB[(Prisma / DB)]
  DB -->|5. User/Account| NextAuth
  NextAuth -->|6. Set Session Cookie / JWT| Browser
  Browser -->|7. Call API (e.g., /api/companies)| API[App API Routes (app/api/*)]
  API -->|8. Verify cookie/token| NextAuth
  API -->|9. Query| DB
  DB -->|10. Data| API
  API -->|11. Response| Browser